--
^CONVERSION ERROR$
any line 175: C\+\+ front-end dropped the body
--
libc++'s std::any __get_fallback_typeid (any:175), dropped because the
address of the constexpr static data member is taken as the address of
its value (test.desc).  clang++ 18 with libc++ accepts the program.
